# Development artefacts. Neither is an input to the build, and the first deploy spent 36MB of its
# 37MB upload on screenshots.
#
# `shots/` is the capture output from `npm run shots`. `brand/` is the X avatar and banners, which
# are uploaded by hand to a platform rather than served — the assets the site actually references
# (og.png, icon-180.png, mark.svg) live in `public/` and are deliberately not listed here.
shots/
brand/
